@startuml
title BMS Operational State Machine

[*] --> Initialization

Initialization --> SelfTest : Initialization complete

SelfTest --> Standby : Self-test passed
SelfTest --> Fault : Self-test failed

Standby --> Precharge : HV enable request

Precharge --> Operating : Precharge successful
Precharge --> Fault : Precharge failure

Operating --> Charging : Charging request
Operating --> Discharging : Drive request

Charging --> Operating : Charging stopped
Discharging --> Operating : Drive stopped

Operating --> Standby : Shutdown request

Charging --> Fault : Critical fault
Discharging --> Fault : Critical fault
Operating --> Fault : Critical fault

Fault --> Standby : Recovery conditions satisfied

Standby --> [*] : Power down

@enduml
